  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The principal targets of the project are the five ( with up to ten possible) selected Governments, (including multiple government departments such as Health and Agriculture, national and sub-national nutrition coordination structures, UN agencies in the 5 + participating countries and the SUN networks in each country. While the immediate beneficiary group is narrow and includes members of the above structures, the wider beneficiary group is much larger and includes those living with or at risk of malnutrition.</narrative>
